<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφῐάλτ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, Acol. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιάλτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					129
				</span></i>
			, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίαλος</span>
				ibid.:—<i>nightmare</i>, conceived as a throttling
			demon, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.Com.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.140
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.26.177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.2.8
			</span></i>; pr. n. of one of the Aloidae, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.385
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.308
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.89
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐπ</span>- acc. to Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				179.22
			</span></i>), and 
				Att.
			 pr. n., cf. Acl.Dion.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				381
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.950.92
			</span></i>, etc. (Identified with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠπιόλης</span> by <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				8.12
			</span></i> (or Apollodorus, v.
			<i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				68
			</span></i> note); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιάλτης</span> is expld.
			as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιγοπύρετον</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; popularly connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφάλλομαι</span>, Sch.B <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.385
			</span></i>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφίαλλω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				403.32
			</span></i>; cf. <i>incubo.</i>) -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ία</span>,
				ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκυσίδη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				1.84
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφιαλτεία</span>
			 (q. v.).</div>
